'''Taylor's''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Village Plaza}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
=== Seymour ===
Located on '''Taylor's''' porch is {{NPCSprite|Seymour (Rift);Seymour}}. They sell {{Item|Exceedingly Comfy Sneakers}} in exchange for {{Item|Gunther's Sneakers}} and {{Motes|49,999}}. Purchasing the former will complete the task "Fancy Sneakers" in the [[Rift Dimension#Rift Guide|Rift Guide]].

=== Reverse-Murder Investigation ===
After scanning the wedding dress in the {{zone|Murder House}} with a {{Item|Detective Scanner}}, {{NPCSprite|Detective Amog}} will appear in '''Taylor's''' basement, next to [[Joliet]] and [[Taylor (Rift)|Rift]]. After talking to {{NPCSprite|Joliet}}, the player must go back to the {{zone|Murder House}} in order to progress in the quest.

